OL,3,GNEWSATrial water tests to remove PFAS
OL,4,A'encouraging'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew techniques to remove "forever
OL,7,Fchemicals" from the island's water
OL,8,Fsupply are "encouraging", Jersey
OL,9,FWater's chief executive has said.
OL,11,FHelier Smith said tests at the water
OL,12,Fcompany's Augres treatment works have
OL,13,Freduced levels of PFAS chemicals by
OL,14,Fabout 30%.
OL,16,FHe said it could cost between #140m and
OL,17,F#210m overall to remove the chemicals
OL,18,Ffrom Jersey's water supply.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
