OL,3,GNEWSATrial water tests to remove PFAS
OL,4,A'encouraging'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever Smith added it was too early to
OL,7,Fdraw full conclusions and a full pilot
OL,8,Ftrial - which he said would cost about
OL,9,F#2m - would take 12 months to complete
OL,10,Fbefore a final report is published at
OL,11,Fthe end of 2027.
